Ige
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
GRIBOC 6 FACE_ALL
GRIBOC 9 FACE_ALL
GRIBOC 5 FACE_ALL
GRIBOC 6 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE GRIBOC GRIBOC
OR
    SRC Suit {HEARTS, SPADES}
    SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK GRIBOC GRIBOC
DESTSRC Rank ascending
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL GRIBOC Empty
        PILE ALL GRIBOC Empty
    PILE ALL GRIBOC Empty
